tomation, add a ticket for each task\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"home-bento__item-text\"> <span class=\"home-bento__item-label\">Collaborate</span> <h3 class=\"home-bento__item-title\">Works where your team works</h3> <p class=\"home-bento__item-subtitle\">Ask Devin to triage Datadog incidents, route Slack messages, and tackle Linear tickets. Or automate entirely using the Devin API and Devin Automations.</p> </div> <div class=\"home-bento__item-image-main-wrapper-mobile\"> <picture> <img src=\"/_astro/work-team-collaborate.DUTTDeCn.png\" alt=\"Create automation, add a ticket for each task\"> </picture> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"home-bento__item-03\" class=\"home-bento__item\"> <div class=\"o-rimlight\"></div> <div class=\"home-bento__item-inner\"> <div class=\"home-bento__item-image-line-wrapper\"> <img src=\"/_astro/card03-line-03.B6ZD_32F.png\" alt=\"\"> </div> <div class=\"home-bento__item-image-main-wrapper\"> <picture> <img src=\"/_astro/bento03.BnRibJnj.png\" alt=\"Devin spins up a team of Devins for large tasks\"> </picture> </div> <div class=\"home-bento__item-text\"> <h3 class=\"home-bento__item-title\">Multi-week, multi-repo projects</h3> <p class=\"home-bento__item-subtitle\">Devin can spin up a team of Devins for large tasks. Devin gets better over time by reading past session trajectories.</p> </div> <div class=\"home-bento__item-image-main-wrapper-mobile\"> <picture> <source srcset=\"/_astro/bento03.BnRibJnj.png\" media=\"(min-width: 940px)\"> <img src=\"/_astro/bento-mobile03.C3gKoWhi.png\" alt=\"Devin spins up a team of Devins for large tasks\"> </picture> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id=\"home-integration\" class=\"o-section\" data-analytics-section=\"integrations\"> <div class=\"o-container\"> <h2 id=\"home-integration__title\"> <span id=\"home-integration__title-wrapper\"> Able to work",
